603190002144018.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">内马尔本人在其youtube频道发布了一条vlog，视频记录了他在3月14日至16日期间的部分日常。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-19/69bad80bee76enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">赛中吃直红！官方：赫塔费后卫阿布卡尔摸瑟尔洛特下体被禁赛两场</a></p><p><span style=" 0, 0);">官方消息，</span>对<span style=" 0, 0);">在上周马竞对阵赫塔费的比赛中，摸马竞前锋瑟尔洛特下体被红牌罚下的</span>阿布卡尔处以禁赛两场的处罚。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-19/69bae2855e5b4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴黎官方：巴尔科拉右脚踝严重扭伤，可能无法出战欧冠1/4决赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241007/6703d0838f653.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241007/6703d0838f653.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241007/6703d0838f653.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">巴黎圣日耳曼官方宣布，边锋巴尔科拉在对阵切尔西的比赛中右脚踝严重扭伤，将缺阵数周。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-19/69bb021370fc8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世体：晋级欧冠八强让巴萨获得1250万欧，本届总收入1亿零343万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.4" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b705c9d2ff9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.4" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em